@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:5151
@invoiceId = 1
@undoToken = replace-with-undoSave-token-from-the-get-response

### Dashboard for all parties
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard

### Dashboard for one party, with all-party benchmarks for the same dates
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard?fy=26-27&month=2026-10&party=TEST%20PARTY

### Everything the dashboard screen adds up itself: every month per party, and today's queue and stock
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/facts

### Answers 304 Not Modified while nothing changed (paste the ETag of the last answer)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/facts
If-None-Match: "replace-with-the-etag"

### One financial year (April 2026 to March 2027) of entries, party-wise entries, Aawak rows and bills; a month= wins
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/entries?fy=2026

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/partywise?fy=2026&party=TEST%20PARTY

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/arrivals?fy=2026

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/invoices?fy=2026

### Every bill month with its number of bills (saved or cancelled), newest first
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/invoices/months

### Read the current bill and undo eligibility
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/invoices/{{invoiceId}}

### Undo a never-issued latest save; cancelled and imported bills are refused
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/invoices/{{invoiceId}}/undo-save
Content-Type: application/json
X-MPH-Request: 1

{
  "neverIssued": true,
  "token": "{{undoToken}}"
}

### Missing never-issued confirmation is refused
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/invoices/{{invoiceId}}/undo-save
Content-Type: application/json
X-MPH-Request: 1

{
  "neverIssued": false,
  "token": "{{undoToken}}"
}

### An old ID does not address a replacement bill
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/invoices/9223372036854775807
